      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why not just use the current doc string contents in `VerifyErrorCode`? Or just print out the name of the enum variant? That would be much more consistent and avoid the subtly incorrect terms introduced below. Having a totally separate set of descriptions for the same set of errors will only increase confusion.",
      "revId": "3e308e9a5621ccbf335a8abc2ce4f05a59f44ef7",
