      "writtenOn": "2023-10-27T18:23:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not just a \"wrong\" key, it\u0027s a key that isn\u0027t structured correctly. I would call it a `Bad key` or `Inconsistent key`, not a `Wrong key`, since that implies it could be returned if the value is signed validly with a key that the system doesn\u0027t recognize.\n\nSo, don\u0027t say \"Wrong\", because these errors are about the item itself being incorrectly structured instead of having a correctly structured, but incorrectly chosen, item.",
